{"title":"The Old Matriarch","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Old Matriarch is a named <a href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch-elder\">Elder Matriarch</a> seen at level 49–58.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Old Matriarch</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Matriarch&#39;s Roost</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 4×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5105\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-old-matriarch\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e3f28ad352b376c76e56.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/fleetfeather-boots-feet\"><b>Fleetfeather Boots</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Bearhide Feet, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">+5% movement speed.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0062997c736826d49ebb.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/oakbark-shield\"><b>Oakbark Shield</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Gold Shield, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Melee attackers take 8% of their hit back. Half as strong against players.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/42f74c164b26deff4eb1.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/harriers-longbow\"><b>Harrier&#39;s Longbow</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Black Walnut Longbow, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">+15% damage against a target more than 4 tiles away.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9fa142035756a98cfeba.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/shriekers-staff\"><b>Shrieker&#39;s Staff</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Black Walnut Staff, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">6% of damage spells stun the primary target for 1 second. The stun lasts half as long on players.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"flight-feather\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e99c04a7b052d79e71e0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Flight Feather</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silverhide-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9dc373df2a9348093eb1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silverhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gravewrap-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/cc804dd20cf180ac1c3b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gravewrap Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/50d7c15d7799aaad4968.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Old Matriarch</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch-elder\">Elder Matriarch</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>49–58</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>7,830</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>18 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}